38	    /**
39	     * Computes the initials of an owner formatted as the upper-cased first letters of the
40	     * first and last name, dot-separated with a trailing dot, e.g. {@code 'J.S.'}.
41	     *
42	     * @param owner the owner, may be {@code null}
43	     * @return the formatted initials, or {@code null} if {@code owner} is {@code null}
