281	     * upper-cased and its remaining letters lower-cased, while the original whitespace is left
282	     * untouched. For example {@code "san   FRANCISCO"} becomes {@code "San   Francisco"}.
283	     *
284	     * @param city the city to title-case
285	     * @return the title-cased city
286	     */
